Package: gologo
Version: @VERSION@
Section: education
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Cyril Lamy <cyril.lamy@gmail.com>
Depends: libc6, libx11-6, libxkbcommon0, libgl1, libegl1, libwayland-client0, libwayland-egl1, libxcursor1
Description: GoLogo - bilingual Logo interpreter
 A modern, cross-platform re-creation of the French Logo from the 1984
 Thomson MO5 (SOLI) cartridge: turtle graphics, built-in bilingual help,
 ready-to-run examples and little games. Free software under GPL v2.
